<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL: THRACE PLASTICS TRADES EX-DIV.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL: THRACE PLASTICS TRADES EX-DIV.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said</p>
<p>that shares of synthetics manufacturer Thrace Plastics </p>
<p>will trade ex-dividend on Friday.</p>
<p>    COMPANY	     DIVIDEND/SHARE     ADJUSTED START PRICE</p>
<p>    Thrace Plastics	  115			  1,730</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
